            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The revised schedule with go-live in January is approved. The project manager will inform the works council and the affected departments by the end of next week."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The increase in the total budget to EUR 4.95 million is approved, subject to the review of the contingency. The final amount will be confirmed at the next meeting."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The old warehouse will remain operational until the end of February as a fallback solution."
